[00:19.16]There was a time we did not know
[00:24.32]The way a Christian ought to go.
[00:31.24]Then Jehovah sent the light,
[00:37.42]His Kingdom truth so clear and bright.
[00:44.10]Our Father’s will we then could see
[00:49.16]To serve the grand Theocracy,
[00:55.26]To declare Jehovah’s fame,
[01:02.76]And help to glorify his holy name.
[01:08.78]We witness now to all we meet,
[01:14.70]From door to door and on the street.
[01:21.18]We take the time to help them see;
[01:27.54]We teach the truth that sets us free.
[01:34.08]And as we strive in ev’ry land
[01:40.28]Jehovah’s worship to expand,
[01:46.28]May we serve our God as one
[01:52.92]Until Jehovah says the work is done.
